Third-party attribution
=======================

formats.json retains selected credential formats originally ported from
magpie's internal/redact package: https://github.com/yetone/magpie (MIT).
core.json and contexts.json are evot's own rule data.

The default rules do not import Betterleaks' bulk catalog. Adding a format
requires a distinctive credential syntax and positive/negative examples;
there is no generated catalog or automatic upstream rule import.

The separation between fixed formats and conservative assignment detection
was informed by https://github.com/svn-arv/redacted (MIT). No source code or
rule data from that project is copied here.

